Z||000005||Stroker||10-31-1999||05:17 PM||||sinoloa,<BR>      Ed Parks at The Fiero Factory (256-420-5391)has Fiero ECM's for $50.That includes everything(ecm,calpak,and prom)ready to go.<BR>  These are used but they work fine.I have purchased one from him and was very satisfied.Besides, if it didn't work, Ed would send you another one free(once you sent the other one back)||||reg||1
